    "AGG_ENERGY": "AGG_CONT plus per-site total MWh matched to FULL_JOB \u2014 same workload energy but still continuous/deferrable; ignores task size and scheduling resolution.",
    "AGG_POOL": "AGG_CONT plus per-operator pooled MWh (sites within operator can trade energy) \u2014 even more optimistic cross-site flexibility than job-level migration allows.",
    "FCFS": "E01 baseline portfolio; no reallocation/slack/termination.",
    "FIXED_DC": "168 h flat load at site mean \u2014 no temporal flexibility."
